              "compliance": "opaque",
              "why_not_absorbed": "A different product class. These wrap SIMULATORS \u2014 you give them a model and they run it \u2014 where DOE-MCP serves published data. Wrapping a simulator means owning its installation, its version compatibility, and its runtime, none of which the provenance envelope has anything useful to say about. The 185 or more combined tools would also breach the sizing ceiling ninefold.",
