              "id": "genesis-lane-servers",
              "name": "DOE Genesis Mission MCP deployments (gated)",
              "maintainer": "Various DOE national laboratories",
              "status": "watch",
              "compliance": "opaque",
              "why_not_absorbed": "Access-gated by design and pointed at internal instruments, facilities, and compute. Wrapping a gated server would produce a tool that fails for every public user, which is worse than not having it. The named watch items are BNL's PanDA MCP, Argonne's Globus-service MCPs, LBNL's CBorg, and the gated Genesis Skills repository on OSTI's GitLab.",
              "install": {
